# Goal

Compare JIA joint antibody HCDR3 sequences against known COVID-binding antibodies from CoV-AbDab.

This version keeps the JIA input logic but adds the richer CoV-AbDab comparison logic and plots from the PRIDE script:

1. Exact overlap screens  
2. Same-length HCDR3 similarity screens  
3. Same-length + same-IGHV screens  
4. Conservative-substitution-aware screens  
5. Targeted indel-tolerant screens  
6. Threshold interpretation tables  
7. PRIDE-style scientific plots  

Only JIA joint samples are included. Joint samples are defined as folders ending in `_LK` or `_RK`.

